            <description><![CDATA[<h3>toutDeSuite 1.0.7</h3><ul>
<li>toutDeSuite now opens on the Suite Monitor</li>
<li>Tabs reordered: Monitor, Move, Delete, then Queue</li>
<li>New Job, Pause and job counts appear on the Queue tab only</li>
<li>The Queue tab shows how many jobs are active, so transfers stay visible from any tab</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
