            <description><![CDATA[<h3>toutDeSuite 1.0.6</h3><ul>
<li>Updates now install themselves: toutDeSuite checks at launch and hourly, then offers to update and relaunch</li>
<li>Check for Updates… in the toutDeSuite menu</li>
<li>Fixed: the Download button on older versions fetched 1.0.0 instead of the latest build</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
